      "writtenOn": "2022-12-09T21:42:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Refactoring this to do so becomes very ugly. We\u0027d have to instantiate `buildCtx` with nothing but `writer` (as `log` and other fields depend on `met`)and then patch them into `buildCtx.ContextImpl.Metrics` and other such fields. I think that\u0027s a fairly disgusting patch.\n\nAnother possible refactor: write a simple `IsThisUploadOnly` method that checks args for `--metrics-upload-only`. I can\u0027t fathom that this has the possibility of collision and saves us a headache.",
      "parentUuid": "273f696f_b10d1162",
